    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast the spell, and as a Bonus Action until it ends, you can make two attacks with a weapon that fires Arrows or Bolts, such as a Longbow or a Light Crossbow. The spell magically creates the ammunition needed for each attack. Each Arrow or Bolt it creates deals damage like a nonmagical piece of ammunition of its kind and disintegrates as soon as it hits or misses.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-OxjTNLTpil4LbruX\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Make the two attacks with your weapon; the spell’s ammunition isn’t spent.</p></section>",
